{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16106312","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16106312","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1610631201:1":{"text":"What is it? Tell me his name!","source_cn":"怎么回事？他的名字怎么了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF9879F7F83736DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1610631202:1":{"text":"I-I can't say it! Every time I try, it's like... my tongue is pulled back down my throat!","source_cn":"我……我说不出来！他的名字……呜！一提到就讲不出话……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF89905D10FD62169","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1610631203:1":{"text":"Try writing it down. There's a pen and paper on the desk.","source_cn":"桌子上有纸笔，你试试写出来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4EDBE7E9EE3C85B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1610631204:1":{"text":"I can't. My hand freezes before I can write it down.","source_cn":"……也……也不行，我的手……写到他的名字时就会动不了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB52E639A7CFB7EF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1610631205:1":{"text":"Looks like some kind of <style=\"highlight\">secrecy spell</style>. Headmistress Durella, can you break it?","source_cn":"看来是种特殊的<style=highlight>守秘魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BCA78274F5D83C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1610631206:1":{"text":"Ahem... This type of magic is rather intricate. I'm going to need some time to analyze it, then consult with a few colleagues.","source_cn":"咳，这种魔法很特别，不是一时半刻能够解决的……我需要和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CD483AFB4E6E95E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1610631207:1":{"text":"Then I'll leave that to you.","source_cn":"那么解开守秘魔法限制这件事就拜托你了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9036E078A695B411","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1610631208:1":{"text":"Niall, do you know how many students have signed this pact?","source_cn":"尼尔，你知不知道学校里有多少学生签订过这个契约？认不认...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BB465F41B9F18DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1610631209:1":{"text":"No idea.","source_cn":"有不少学生都私下听说过“能增加魔力的契约”这件事……或...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19E60E7E6EA6CE81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1610631210:1":{"text":"No one talks about it. It's against school regulations and the Mage's Code. I thought no one would find out...","source_cn":"没有人会到处宣扬这件事的，谁都知道这违反了学校规定，也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBCE9366895020D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1610631211:1":{"text":"Where did you learn about this pact, and how was it signed?","source_cn":"你从哪里知道这个魔力契约，又是怎样签约的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5327DA21D80B438","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1610631212:1":{"text":"I... Ngh! I can't say it!","source_cn":"在……呜！我……我说不出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47A1A20C540B72E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1610631213:1":{"text":"Was it someone from the school? A student? A faculty member?","source_cn":"和你签订契约的是学校的人，某个学生或者教职工？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB04FA362AB7B54CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1610631214:1":{"text":"No... He has never come to the school... Ngh!","source_cn":"不是学校里的人。他从来不进学校……呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6F4E20FB5E2A40D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1610631215:1":{"text":"An outsider. Where do the students hang out? Holt Street, right? Did you sign the pact here?","source_cn":"看来你很确定他是校外人士。除了莱希拉姆内，学生最常去的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CCFE16F938CAA1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1610631216:1":{"text":"Ngh... Ngh!","source_cn":"呜……呜！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x780E1C1128BD5C76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1610631217:1":{"text":"You can't say it? Then that must be the right answer. A shop there, perhaps?","source_cn":"说不出来？看来就是了，是这里的某家商店？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6F24E3D8A5D0A7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1610631218:1":{"text":"It's the... Ngh. My favorite... Ngh!","source_cn":"是……呜……很喜欢的……呜！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x653B7088B0B93DB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1610631219:1":{"text":"A shop popular among students, huh? Say I find it, is there some kind of code word or secret gesture I need to know to make contact?","source_cn":"一家学生都很喜欢的店？嗯……是只要找到这家店就可以，还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2411C8DA38E430EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1610631220:1":{"text":"Ngh...","source_cn":"呜……<key:dialog63>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x762441F7E5563BAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1610631221:1":{"text":"So, that's a yes. Alright, Headmistress Durella, please escort him out.","source_cn":"看来有特殊暗号。我明白了……杜瑞拉女士，麻烦你带他离开吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x371178B62F6D2596","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伊芙":{"text":"Evie","source":"伊芙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:尼尔":{"text":"Niall","source":"尼尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:杜瑞拉":{"text":"Durella","source":"杜瑞拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":22,"localized_text_count":21,"speaker_count":3}}